{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "df360-salesforce-live-mcp-v2",
    "name": "digiField360 Mobile Developer API Collection (Salesforce Live & MCP)",
    "description": "🚀 **Official digiField360 Mobile Developer API Collection**\n\nThis collection contains all production and development API endpoints for the **digiField360 Mobile Application** (React Native / Flutter / iOS / Android / PWA).\n\n### 🔑 Key Capabilities:\n1. **Cloud 24/7 Endpoint**: Defaults to `https://digifields-360.onrender.com` (works anywhere without local hosting).\n2. **Authentication**: JWT Bearer Token generation & OAuth 2.0 relay.\n3. **Generic Salesforce CRUD**: Real-time Query, Get by ID, Create, Update, Delete, Child Relationships across any Salesforce object.\n4. **Field Service Domain Operations**: Morning Pre-Load Sync, Work Order Lifecycle, Time Tracking, Attachment Upload, Job Completion & PDF Report Generation, Offline Queue Replay, GPS Telemetry.\n5. **Agentforce AI**: Diagnostic Troubleshooting (5 languages), Pre-Job AI Briefings, Natural Language to SOQL.\n6. **MCP JSON-RPC 2.0**: Standards-compliant Model Context Protocol tool execution.\n\n### ⚡ Variable Chaining:\nRunning **1.2 Login** automatically sets `{{authToken}}` and `{{technicianId}}`.\nRunning **2.2 Create New Record** automatically sets `{{recordId}}`.\nRunning **3.2 List Work Orders** automatically sets `{{workOrderId}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
